The situation became serious when Nicholas arrived at a Pokémon Center.

Nurse Joy smiled.

“Welcome!”

Nicholas stopped dead.

He slowly looked toward another Nurse Joy standing across the room.

Then another through a window across the street.

His face changed.

“No.”

Nurse Joy frowned.

“Sir?”

Nicholas pointed between them.

“No no no no no.”

He ran outside.

Another Nurse Joy was walking down the road.

Nicholas screamed.

“THEY’RE CLONES.”

People stopped.

“The entire medical infrastructure is compromised!”

Officer Jenny approached him.

“Sir, calm down.”

Nicholas turned.

Across the street stood another Officer Jenny.

His jaw dropped.

“Oh COME ON.”

